stateDiagram-v2
    state fork_tests <<fork>>
    state join_tests <<join>>

    [*] --> Checkout
    Checkout --> Build
    Build --> fork_tests
    fork_tests --> UnitTests
    fork_tests --> IntegrationTests
    fork_tests --> Lint
    UnitTests --> join_tests
    IntegrationTests --> join_tests
    Lint --> join_tests
    join_tests --> Deploy
    Deploy --> [*]

    Build --> Failed : compile error
    join_tests --> Failed : any check failed
    Failed --> [*]
